 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Equipment rentals
+
+`createRentalService()` from `src/index.ts` creates an in-memory rental service. Add boards or sails
+with a daily price in integer euro cents, then call `quote({ itemId, start, end })` or
+`book({ itemId, start, end })`. Start and end must be UTC midnight ISO-8601 timestamps; end is
+exclusive, so it is the midnight after the last rental day. Quotes return the total in euro cents.
+Bookings cannot overlap for the same item and receive a service-local ID. Cancellation is not yet
+implemented; the future policy is a full refund except when cancelled less than 24 hours before
+the booking starts, when there is no refund.
